{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳展鵬與陳自瑤今日（8日）出席無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》的電車巡遊活動，期間有一名男士跟保安發生衝突，問到陳自瑤有否被嚇倒時？</p><p>她坦言：「少少啦！</p><p>銅鑼灣係鬧市，啲演員又咁有吸引力，所以難免有少少碰撞，OK，好快冇事。</p><p>」而她昨天在中山出席活動時</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.673781+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:07:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.327673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"44e567a86dd8f5b025c4a7524cd5ef4dba89847acc1b59dbf9a174325121ba46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}